{"metadata":{"title":"Using the Swidux Agent Skill","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swidux ships a companion agent skill ("},{"code":"swidux-ref","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") for AI coding assistants like Claude Code. It contains the architecture rules, conventions, and code templates an assistant needs to generate correct Swidux code without you re-explaining the patterns."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The skill is published in "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" — Heirloom Logic’s public skills repo — alongside any future Heirloom skills. Two files:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SKILL.md"},{"type":"text","text":" — architecture rules (the 10 rules, the dispatch lifecycle, plugin shapes, anti-patterns)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-patterns.md"},{"type":"text","text":" — copy-pasteable code templates for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppState"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppAction"},{"type":"text","text":", reducers, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStore"},{"type":"text","text":" factory, views, plugin wiring, and Swift Testing reducer tests."}]}]}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Installing-the-skill","text":"Installing the skill","type":"heading"},{"level":3,"anchor":"GitHub-CLI-recommended","text":"GitHub CLI (recommended)","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Requires "},{"code":"gh","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" ≥ v2.90.0 ("},{"identifier":"https:\/\/cli.github.com","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type"